// Optional native capability configuration. This file is NEVER included by
// default. After Apple Developer App ID/profile setup, copy to
// SocialAuth.local.xcconfig (gitignored), then uncomment the setting below.
// Leave disabled for provisioning profiles without Sign in with Apple.
// CODE_SIGN_ENTITLEMENTS = Runner/SocialAuth.entitlements
//
// Google client IDs are supplied via Dart defines. The Google iOS callback
// URL scheme must also be added to Info.plist after obtaining the real client
// ID; see docs/social_login_setup.md. Never paste an OAuth client secret here.
